C(U,'15-review-questions','Design is complete only if its applicable review questions can be answered from explicit algebras, carriers, purity/replay evidence, shared types/validation, recorded exceptions, stack preservation, continuation ownership, carrier diagram and escrow classifications.','Reviewing a covered UX design module.','ux_replay','Answerability/coverage is a design-completeness check, not proof that every answered claim is true.',ob='Identify State/Msg/Update; Cmd/Sub; typed Product bindings and truth-changing carriers; membrane/commands; View purity; replay; shared types; seam validation; exemptions; stack justification; continuation under replay; carrier set/diagram; every deferred sprint finding.||Any unanswered applicable question leaves design incomplete.',deps=U+'13-adoption-guidance '+U+'14-failure-pattern',ins='design algebras product_contract effects replay untrusted accessibility sprint')
